    "title": "Digital Forensics at Scale: Principles, Practices, and Strategic Applications",
    "description": "This comprehensive course provides forensic professionals, investigators, and technical staff with an in-depth understanding of digital forensics applied to massive datasets. Designed for personnel involved in investigations, security operations, and compliance, this course establishes a foundational understanding of the principles, methodologies, and tools required for conducting large-scale digital investigations.",
